  m_text: Perhaps one of the most iconic - and easily recognized - pieces of clothing
    from the colonial era is the tri-corner hat, or more simply known as the tricorn.
    Although the style originated in Europe, it is now associated with the American
    Revolutionary War and our nation's fight for freedom.
